.nh
.TH containers-storage-images 1 "August 2016"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
containers-storage-images \- List known images

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBcontainers-storage\fP \fBimages\fP

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Retrieves information about all known images and lists their IDs and names.

.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
containers-storage images
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
containers-storage-image(1)
